ype":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T09:06:29-08:00","id":1372473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joboo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1372457-so-what-are-these-new-products#post1372457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a place where they leak this information?</div> </div> </div> </div>Any spoilers are at Neall and a given book's developer's discretion. The standard operating procedure is not to give spoilers and even if some come out, it is much too early in either of these books production cycles to start talking about what they may contain.<br /> <br /> The Gods reward those who are patient <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T05:50:02-08:00","id":1372685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joboo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1372457-so-what-are-these-new-products#post1372457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know we speculated a bit about Saints and Monsters being a book about supernatural paths, but does anyone have any thoughts on what Wild Hunt will be about? It is very European in origin, but I suppose it could be a book on the fair folk across regions/cultures of the world. It may have nothing do with faeire either. Any thoughts?<br /> <br /> Is there a place where they leak this information?</div> </div> </div> </div>My general feeling is that <b>Scion</b> supplements should either expound upon an area the core didn't completely cover, or should address some lack in the game by providing an alternate take. I made the decision to focus the cores away from the Titanomachy, but this removed the primary antagonists for Scion; thus, <b>Titanomachy</b> was born.<br /> <br /> <b>Wild Hunt</b> isn't a book that's solely about the European Wild Hunt, but more along the lines of global pan-pantheon groups you and your Band might become part of. Although, yes, the Wild Hunt itself is the headliner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T18:33:51-08:00","id":1372864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1372457-so-what-are-these-new-products?p=1372685#post1372685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My general feeling is that <b>Scion</b> supplements should either expound upon an area the core didn't completely cover, or should address some lack in the game by providing an alternate take. I made the decision to focus the cores away from the Titanomachy, but this removed the primary antagonists for Scion; thus, <b>Titanomachy</b> was born.<br /> <br /> <b>Wild Hunt</b> isn't a book that's solely about the European Wild Hunt, but more along the lines of global pan-pantheon groups you and your Band might become part of. Although, yes, the Wild Hunt itself is the headliner.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for that. Sounds cool.<br /> <br /> I want to say I like that you focused the core away from the Titanomancy while still including it as a &quot;thing&quot;. I appreciate how it opened up the game more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11830-joboo","name":"Joboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-06T14:36:30-08:00","id":1373261,"title":"","content":"These all sound cool. I'm still really hoping for the proposed King Arthur/Welsh Pantheon book that was mentioned as a theoretical possibility at one point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}